      "text": "A colossus of fired clay, cast in the mold of the $(l:summons/redstone_monstrosity)Redstone Monstrosity$() with Orange Terracotta in place of redstone.$(br2)Building it needs the Terminus research, and uses up the Animation Core, the core, the terracotta and the ring.$(br2)$(italic)Requires meowhem.$()"
